Cedric Corot is a tall lizardfolk and a famous detective. He wears a black suit with the tie loosened and the collar open, a tan peacoat, and a small black fedora. He can light a cigarette or cigar with his fingers. When he is not working a case he draws political cartoons.

Cedric rarely goes anywhere without his entourage: four devoted followers named Vinny, Tony, Donnie, and Eddie, who see to his needs, sleep in shifts to watch over him, and run errands and gather information on his behalf. They are used to being called the wrong names. They do not leave the city with him.

Cedric is a member of the [[Org/Iridescent Church/Convox/Magical Crimes/index|Magical Crimes Convox]] of the [[Org/Iridescent Church/index|Iridescent Church]].
